## Claude Code
# Shared, committed: .claude/settings.json, commands/, agents/, skills/, hooks/ — anything a
# second person or a CI run would need. Do not ignore .claude/ as a whole; that hides them.

# Written by whoever approved a tool prompt, per machine, and never shared.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Session scratch: the wrap-up handoff CLAUDE.md documents, agent plans, and task lists.
.claude/handoff.md
.claude/plans/
.claude/todos/
.claude/*.log

# Each entry here is a whole checkout; committing one would vendor the repository into itself.
.claude/worktrees/
